title: EMR Connect › Sync › Sync now
route: /emr
intro: A person starts a sync from the card header or from one row. The demo waits two seconds, then adds a result, updates the counters and the activity log, and shows a toast.
dir: TD
also: Demo: simulated. There is no EMR behind the button. Each sync takes the next of four fixed results.
---
start s1 "Click 'Sync now'\nIn the Connected systems header, or on a Connected row"
decision q1 "Is a sync already running?"
endx x1 "Click does nothing\nNo message. Only the running buttons show a spinner"
decision q2 "Which button?"
process p1 "Header button spins\nEvery Connected row shows 'Syncing'"
process p2 "That row's button spins\nIts row shows 'Syncing'"
ext e1 "The EMR answers\nDemo: simulated, two seconds"
decision q4 "Did the person leave EMR Connect meanwhile?"
endx x3 "Sync is dropped\nNothing is recorded"
decision q3 "Is any system in the batch Connected?"
endx x2 "Spinner stops\nNo toast, no log line, tiles unchanged\nOnly possible when every system is Disconnected or needs a look"
process n1 "Take the next result from a list of four\nThe next sync takes the one after, then round again"

group gRes "The four results, in order"
  agent r1 "Reader\n'Pulled 6 new files for 3 open cases and matched the insurance cards'"
  agent r2 "Reader\n'Read 2 new admissions and proposed cases in Case Manager'"
  agent r3 "Verify\n'Re-checked coverage for 4 members after the sync'"
  agent r4 "Reader\n'Pulled the latest progress notes for 9 active stays'"
endgroup

process ap "Apply the result"

group gSaved "What changes"
  store d1 "Each synced system: last sync is now\nRows read 'just now'"
  store d2 "Charts matched today and Files pulled go up\nAbout half when only some of the Connected systems are synced"
  store d3 "Recent activity gets the result as its newest line\nFor one system: '... from {system name}'"
endgroup
toast t1 "'Sync finished'\nThe result text. Green"
end z1 "Last sync tile reads 'Just now'"
goto g1 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Sync › What a sync pulls and when it runs"
goto g2 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Recent activity › Read the activity log"

s1 --> q1
q1 -->|Yes| x1
q1 -->|No| q2
q2 -->|Header| p1
q2 -->|A row| p2
p1 --> e1
p2 --> e1
e1 --> q4
q4 -->|Yes| x3
q4 -->|No| q3
q3 -->|No| x2
q3 -->|Yes| n1
n1 --> r1 & r2 & r3 & r4
r1 & r2 & r3 & r4 --> ap
ap --> d1 & d2 & d3
d1 & d2 & d3 --> t1
t1 --> z1
z1 --> g1
d3 -.-> g2
